1. Times out when nobody says hello, at ~ceiling (use small ceiling like 200ms, chunk 50ms; assert TimeoutException).
2. Resolves when a delayed client says hello after the first chunk window: start wait with ceiling 5s chunk 100ms; delay client connect by 500ms; assert it resolves.
3. Fast path: already-seen → immediate.

That reproduces the flake scenario deterministically (hello arriving past the first 30s... here, past the first chunk).

